# The qemu-armhf image, on UBI in QEMU's NOR flash, on the production profile and OpenRC: the minimal image, the
# management daemon and API and SSH, busybox as the command set; no container engine. The board's only product,
# published: the 32-bit Arm and UBI reference.
PROFILE=prod
INIT=openrc
FEATURES="micad ssh"
COMPONENTS=""
